                                            <h4 style="color:orange">About CIIT </h4>
                                            <p class="card-text mb-3" style="color:black">
                                                CIIT is a leading Skills and Talent Development Corporation that is building a manpower pool for global industry requirements. CIIT is a global leader in Skills and Talent Development, offers multi-disciplinary learning management and training delivery solutions to corporations, institutions, and individuals on various technologies. CIIT has three main lines of business – Corporate Training, Skills and Careers, and School/College Learning.
                                            </p>
                                            <p class="card-text mb-3" style="color:black">
                                                CIIT has been founded by a group of highly qualified professionals with an excelled expertise onto varied technological domains as a center for IT education & training with a vision to make candidates ready for IT industry from day one. We believe in in-depth perfection in whatever we do and we strive to bring it alive through CIIT. CIIT’s training proved that every candidate from fresher to experience got trained on latest IT requirements and became first choice for industries.
                                            </p>
                                            <p class="card-text mb-3" style="color:black">
                                                At CIIT Training Institute, we are committed to helping our students reach their goals and objectives. We strive to provide a positive learning experience for our students and help them find success in their chosen field. We also provide a range of Full Stack Development Training with Stippend till get place.Our commitment to providing quality services and training has resulted in our success in the IT industry. 
                                            </p>
                                            <p class="card-text mb-3" style="color:black">

                                            We have seen rapid growth over the years, with many satisfied customers and students. Our success has been recognized by the industry and our peers, with the opening total <b>three branches (Hadapsar, VimanNagar, Baramati)</b>. At CIIT Training Institute, we are committed to providing a professional and supportive learning environment for our students.
                                            </p>

                                            <p class="card-text mb-3" style="color:black">
                                            We pride ourselves on our dedication to our clients, providing 100% placement assistance to every student who enrolls in our courses. We also provide flexible payment options to suit all budgets, so that no one is excluded from learning new skills. We strive to stay up to date with the latest industry trends and use the latest technologies to provide our students with the best possible experience. Our team of experienced instructors and professionals are always available to provide guidance and support to ensure that our students have the best experience possible.
                                            </p>

